      "message": "fix(runtime): retain transitive pins in isolated model builds\n\nThe production model skips the owner package wrapper when importing its\nauthenticated catalog. Preserve canonical transitive package pinning and\nrun all-dependency NuGet auditing at low severity in that real command.\n\nExercise source and package builds with a real two-version dependency\ngraph; the compiled model must execute the API from the central pin.",
